    tr: "Tur {0}/{1}\n{2} zar att\u0131: {3}"
    es: "Ronda {0}/{1}\n{2} sac\xF3: {3}"
    fr: 'Tour {0}/{1}

      {2} a obtenu : {3}'
    de: "Runde {0}/{1}\n{2} w\xFCrfelte: {3}"
    ko: "\uB77C\uC6B4\uB4DC {0}/{1}\n{2} \uACB0\uACFC: {3}"
    ru: "\u0420\u0430\u0443\u043D\u0434 {0}/{1}\n{2} \u0432\u044B\u0431\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0438\u043B:
      {3}"
  - key: turn.triple_double_penalty
    en: '{0} rolled doubles three times in a row!


      No movement on this third
      roll.

      You cannot roll on your next turn.'
    tr: "{0}, 3 kez \xFCst \xFCste \xE7ift att\u0131!\n\nBu \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC at\u0131\u015Fta
      hareket yok.\nBir sonraki turunda zar atamazs\u0131n."
    es: "\xA1{0} sac\xF3 dobles tres veces seguidas!\n\nNo hay movimiento en esta
      tercera tirada.\nNo podr\xE1s tirar en tu pr\xF3ximo turno."
    fr: "{0} a fait trois doubles de suite !\n\nAucun d\xE9placement sur ce troisi\xE8me
      lancer.\nImpossible de lancer au prochain tour."
    de: "{0} hat dreimal hintereinander einen Pasch gew\xFCrfelt!\n\nBeim dritten
      Wurf gibt es keine Bewegung.\nIm n\xE4chsten Zug darf nicht gew\xFCrfelt werden."
    ko: "{0}\uB2D8\uC774 3\uBC88 \uC5F0\uC18D \uB354\uBE14\uC744 \uAD74\uB838\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4!\n\n\uC138
      \uBC88\uC9F8 \uAD74\uB9BC\uC5D0\uB294 \uC774\uB3D9\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uB2E4\uC74C
      \uD134\uC5D0\uB294 \uC8FC\uC0AC\uC704\uB97C \uAD74\uB9B4 \uC218 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    ru: "{0} \u0432\u044B\u0431\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0438\u043B \u0434\u0443\u0431\u043B\u044C
      \u0442\u0440\u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0430 \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0440\u044F\u0434!\n\n\u041D\u0430
      \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044C\u0435\u043C \u0431\u0440\u043E\u0441\u043A\u0435
      \u0434\u0432\u0438\u0436\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F \u043D\u0435\u0442.\n\u0412
      \u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044E\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0445\u043E\u0434 \u0431\u0440\u043E\u0441\u043E\u043A
      \u043F\u0440\u043E\u043F\u0443\u0441\u043A\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F."
  - key: turn.extra_roll
    en: "Round {0}/{1}\n{2}: doubles ({3}+{4}) \u2014 roll again!"
    tr: "Tur {0}/{1}\n{2}: \xE7ift zar ({3}+{4}) \u2014 tekrar zar at!"
    es: "Ronda {0}/{1}\n{2}: dobles ({3}+{4}) \u2014 \xA1tira otra vez!"
    fr: "Tour {0}/{1}\n{2} : double ({3}+{4}) \u2014 relancez !"
